      "q": "How much does Dell Federal Systems L P make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Dell Federal Systems L P has $1.2B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Dell Federal Systems L P received 453 awards this fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $2.7M, and obligations are down 6.7% year over year. Historical obligations were $1.6B in FY21, $1.7B in FY22, $1.4B in FY23, $1.5B in FY24, and $1.3B in FY25."
